# LF in the repo and in the working tree, whatever the local core.autocrlf says. This repo asserts
# byte-exact things: the patch the injector applies is measured in bytes, and harvested class maps
# are compared snapshot to snapshot across extension versions. A checkout that rewrote line endings
# would make both depend on whose machine they ran on.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Harvested from the extension bundle, not written by hand. Marked generated so review tools
# collapse them by default, but NOT -diff: these exist to be diffed across extension versions, and
# -diff makes git treat them as binary, which is the one thing they must not be.
packages/plugin-api/src/generated.ts linguist-generated
